| Surface | `c_parse_secret_env` |
|---------|----------------------|
| `ooda/runtime/chs_rt*.c` / `.h` | **absent** |
| `ooda/oodac/c_emit_secret.oo` | **definition** |
| Product `oodac` ELF | **T** (compiler, not runtime) |

chs_rt only implements the string floor the walk lowers to. No second
C copy of the SECRET-directive scanner.

